  "notes": "The Great Lavra Bell Tower in Kyiv around the July 2013 Qualla photographs, including the yellow masonry base, three white-columned upper stages, open belfries, gilded dome, lantern and cross. Other monastery buildings and surrounding walls are separate structures. The footprint is centered from its named map object. This is roughly 10m north of the story coordinate. Upper-stage sections and octagon rotation require photo interpretation."
